          <attvalue for="34" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Rapid expansion of export controls legally blocks shipments, forces cancellation or delay of cross-border contracts and FDI approvals, and prompts multinationals to halt or repatriate investment, reducing net cross-border capital flows." />
