          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Tighter sanctions on Russian energy exports tighten global supply buffers and raise prices, prompting rerouting, heavier shipping volumes through chokepoints and competitive market pressures that make regional energy shipments more vulnerable to disruption from Iranian-linked attacks or interdictions." />
