          <attvalue for="34" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Stricter enforcement actions (e.g., inspections, interdictions, secondary sanctions) reduce circumvention and thereby translate into a de facto increase in the aggregate restrictiveness and reach of sanctions against actors tied to Russian oil." />
