          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Sustained increases in long-term sovereign yields raise debt‑servicing costs for regional states and their proxy networks, forcing near‑term budget cuts to mobilization, sustainment, and large‑scale operations, which reduces pressure toward broader military escalation." />
