          <attvalue for="34" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A rise in long-term sovereign yields increases borrowing and refinancing costs for Western governments and private donors, tightening fiscal space for sustained military and economic support to Ukraine and thereby increasing Russia's relative bargaining leverage." />
